  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "This is a renamed version of the NES game Onyanko Town and comes from the Dynavision 101 in 1 multicart. \r\n\r\nIn Onyanko Town, a kitten named Michael has wandered outside its house and has now gotten lost. Now, it's up to the kitten's mother, Milky, to search all over the town trying to locate the kitten and return it to their household.\r\n\r\nThe game is set in a town viewed from a top-down perspective. The player control the mother cat. The mother cat has the ability to jump and to open or close any manhole covers that are close by. While searching for the lost kitten, the mother cat is harassed by enemy dogs that want to harm her. There are other obstacles that the mother cat has to be wary of such as oncoming traffic, snakes, traffic cones, and open manhole covers which she can fall into if she is not careful."
    }
  ],
